// Job queue health (DIAAT-277): the recording batch polling loop's heartbeat, 15-minute
// bins. transcription.poller.last_success_age = seconds since the loop last completed a
// poll (or since it started). It rises past a few poll intervals
// (BATCH_POLL_INTERVAL_SECONDS, 30 s) only when the loop is stuck or every poll fails.
// Max per replica: the worst. The loop runs in transcribe-api-worker (the gauge is
// registered with the pollers), so replicas are cloud_RoleInstance of that service.
// Recording-only metric, so no area filter: metric dimensions do not carry hmcts.area
// (decision 1). Dictation's poller has no heartbeat metric.
customMetrics
| where name == "transcription.poller.last_success_age"
| summarize last_success_age_s = max(value) by bin(timestamp, 15m), cloud_RoleInstance
| order by timestamp asc
